cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "eQTL-source discordance in transcriptome-wide association studies: analysis code and processed data"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, processed data and a containerized reproducibility environment for a
  methodological audit of eQTL weight-source dependence in transcriptome-wide association
  studies. With the GWAS input and analytic pipeline held fixed, the audit quantifies how
  the choice of eQTL weight source (GTEx v8 versus eQTLGen) changes TWAS gene candidacy,
  calibrates the resulting rates against disease-agnostic controls, and benchmarks the
  framework on an independent genome-wide trait.
type: software
